  "architecture": {
    "title": "Close the loop — score, serve, route, gate",
    "caption": "Module 09 trains a LoRA adapter on the Spark. This module scores it against a prompt-only baseline with one shared scorer (_hotel_eval.py), serves it on vLLM as an adapter (or merged, or as GGUF on Ollama), and puts one LiteLLM alias in front with a fallback chain. The ship gate decides; the fallback header tells you when the fine-tune is silently not serving.",
